==Description==
'''Ice Skating''' is an emote that could have been obtained at Level 17 of the premium [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] track. It was made by STEALTH_NOVA. The emote is looped and no music can be heard while performing the emote. The player is unable to interact with it.

Upon use, the player gains ice skates that force them to move. Colliding with walls or steep surfaces will cause for a bump sound effect to play and make the skates try to avoid the obstacle.

It had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|500}} or {{Robux|94}} ({{Robux|75}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale), with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|3,990}} or {{Robux|1,351}} ({{Robux|1,074}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

